lofibox (0.2.2-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.2.
  * Persist local media roots through SourceProfilesDomain local-root profiles
    with source and library CLI command surfaces.
  * Default unconfigured local library startup to ~/Music through application
    services, including /root/Music when HOME=/root.
  * Add runtime library-refresh for running-instance configured-root rescans.
  * Fix Windows/MSVC UTF-8 source compilation and curl helper lookup.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0800

lofibox (0.2.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix Cardputer Zero APPLaunch startup through a wrapper that inherits
    APPLaunch framebuffer and keyboard device paths with ST7789V fallback
    detection.
  * Install a Cardputer-sized APPLaunch icon instead of linking the 180x180
    hicolor desktop icon.
  * Keep /usr/lib/lofibox/lofibox_zero_device stable for APPLaunch across
    Linux device build configurations.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Mon, 11 May 2026 16:30:00 +0800

